            </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://shop.sciencemuseum.org.uk/  \" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shop</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://wonderlabplus.sciencemuseumgroup.org.uk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wonderlab+</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://blog.sciencemuseum.org.uk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Blog</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/account/create/brief\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Newsletter</a>\n                      </li>\n    \n          <li>\n        <div class=\"site-search-form c-search-mob\" data-drupal-selector=\"site-search-form-2\" id=\"block-sitesearchform-mobile\">\n  \n  <div class=\"c-search-mob__form\">\n    \n        \n        <form autocomplete=\"off\" block=\"block-sitesearchform-mobile\" action=\"/see-and-do/t-rex-3d-pg\" method=\"post\" id=\"site-search-form-mobile\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <div class=\"js-form-item form-item form-type-search js-form-type-search form-item-term js-form-item-term\">\n      <label for=\"edit-term-mobile\">\n    Search the site\n\n      </label>\n        <input data-drupal-selector=\"edit-term\" data-msg-maxlength=\"Search the site field has a maximum length of 128.\" type=\"search\" id=\"edit-term-mobile\" name=\"term\" value=\"\" size=\"60\" maxlength=\"128\" class=\"form-search\" />\n\n        </div>\n<input data-drupal-selector=\"form-5c5-vncqbzi-orpn3lc3vf3r3-dh6cy7scrue26nwps\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_build_id\" value=\"form-5c5_vNCqbZi_ORpN3lc3vf3R3-DH6cY7SCRue26nWPs\" />\n<input data-drupal-selector=\"edit-site-search-form-2\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"site_search_form\" />\n<div data-drupal-selector=\"edit-actions\" class=\"form-actions js-form-wrapper form-wrapper\" id=\"edit-actions-mobile\">\n\n<button  data-drupal-selector=\"site-search-form-button\" type=\"submit\" id=\"site-search-form-button-mobile\" name=\"op\" value=\"Submit\" class=\"button js-form-submit form-submit btn btn--primary\">\n  Submit\n  <svg class=\"o-icon btn__icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n  </svg>\n</button></div>\n\n</form>\n\n      </div>\n\n</div>\n\n      </li>\n        </ul>\n          </div>\n    </div>\n      \n\n  </nav>\n  </div>\n    </header>\n        <div id=\"main-wrapper\" class=\"o-main-wrapper clearfix\">\n      <div id=\"main\" class=\"clearfix\">\n        \n        <main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                            \n\n<div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n\n                              \n                      <article class=\"h-relative\">\n  \n  \n<div class=\"h-relative\">\n  <div class=\"c-banner-medium c-banner-medium--media\">\n    \n  \n    \n    <div class=\"c-banner-medium__element c-banner-medium__element--color\" style=\"background:#496a78\">\n      <div class=\"c-banner-medium__column\" style=\"color:#496a78\">\n                  <img src=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/her/public/2024-12/Adult%20Rex%20Sunset%20Burst.jpg?h=c3d4457c&amp;itok=3lAxPN41\" class=\"c-banner-medium__img\" alt=\"\"/>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-banner-medium__overlay\">\n      <div class=\"c-banner-medium__container | o-container\">\n        <div class=\"c-breadcrumb  | js-breadcrumb\">\n              <span class=\"visually-hidden\">You are here:</span>\n    <ol class=\"o-list c-breadcrumb__links\">\n    \n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/\">\n                          <svg class=\"o-icon c-breadcrumb__divider-icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n                <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n              </svg>\n                        Home\n          </a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/see-and-do\">\n                        See and do\n          </a>\n              </li>\n        </ol>\n\n        </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"visually-hidden\"><span class=\"h-relative\">T. rex 3D (PG)</span>\n</h1>\n\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"c-banner-medium__title | o-title o-title--primary\">\n          <span class=\"js-cascade\"><span class=\"h-relative\">T. rex 3D (PG)</span>\n</span>\n        </div>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n    <div class=\"o-main-content | js-sticky-container\">\n    <!-- Body content -->\n    <div class=\"o-body -first\">\n      <div class=\"o-container u-order\">\n        <div class=\"o-content u-order-body\">\n          <div class=\"c-wysiwyg\">\n              <div class=\"o-text-introduction\">\n                            <p>Discover the planet’s fiercest, most famous dinosaur in dazzling 3D.</p>\n\n      \n              </div>\n                          <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">For over a hundred years, dinosaurs have sparked our curiosity and wonder. This epic new big-screen adventure brings together top tyrannosaur scientists, a coalition of natural history institutions, and pioneering paleo and visual effects artists to delve into the world of this iconic dinosaur and its carnivorous Cretaceous cousins.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><div class=\"embedded-entity\"><div>\n                  <div class=\"video-embed-field-provider-youtube video-embed-field-responsive-video\"><iframe width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jXI-FdCZBM4?autoplay=0&amp;start=0&amp;rel=0\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n      \n  </div>\n</div><p>From rexling to teen rex to hulking adult, the interplay between speculation and evidence will be explored revealing how much science contributed to the understanding of these legendary dinosaurs.</p><p>Get ready to witness the wonder years of this ultimate predator and have a roaring-good time along the way. Don’t miss out—book early to get cheaper prices.  </p>\n      \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"o-sidebar-wrapper-fixed  u-order-sidebar | js-sticky-sidebar\" data-sidebar-spacer=\"false\">\n          <div class=\"o-container\">\n            <div class=\"o-sidebar\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 class=\"visually-hidden\">Information</h2>\n                \n\n\n<div class=\"c-info-block c-info-block--primary\">\n  <ul class=\"c-info-block__list o-list\">\n        <li class=\"o-title o-title--tertiary c-info-block__title -first\">\n                  IMAX screening\n      \n    </li>\n        <li class=\"c-info-block__section\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                  <li><span class=\"o-label\">Date:</span>             Now screening\n      </li>\n                                  <li><span class=\"o-label\">Duration:</span>              60 minutes including adverts\n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Price:</span>             £14. Book early for cheaper prices. Ages 3 and under go free. No booking fees apply \n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Location:</span> IMAX: The Ronson Theatre\n      <span class=\"separator\">, </span>\n  Level 0</li>\n                <!-- Age and Height Restrictions -->\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Age:</span>             Children under 12 must be accompanied by an adult\n      </li>\n                <!-- Festival \"parents\" -->\n              </ul>\n    </li>\n            <li class=\"c-info-block__section\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                <li>\n          <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/events?view=calendar&amp;kid=756\" class=\"btn btn--primary -on-black\">\n            Book now\n            <svg class=\"o-icon btn__icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n              <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n        </li>\n                      </ul>\n    </li>\n                \n    \n  </ul>\n</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n                    \n<div class=\"o-body\">\n  <div class=\"o-container\">\n    <div class=\"o-content\">\n      <section class=\"slice view-mode-default c-accordion clearfix | js-accordion\" >\n              \n        <h2  class=\"c-accordion__section-title\">            Ticket \n      </h2>\n                                  <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-1\">\n\t  <span>            Save 50% on tickets\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-1\">\n              <p><span>You can also get 50% off IMAX documentary tickets when you book day passes for </span><em><span>Wonderlab</span></em><span> or </span><em><span>Power Up</span></em><span>. You will automatically receive the discount when you add them to your basket. &nbsp;</span></p>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-2\">\n\t  <span>            Book early to get cheaper ticket prices\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-2\">\n              <div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW85201354 BCX8\"><ul><li><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Save £1 per ticket when you book 1 – 6 days before your visit </span><span class=\"EOP SCXW85201354 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW85201354 BCX8\"><ul><li><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Save £2 per ticket when you book 7 – 13 days before your visit </span><span class=\"EOP SCXW85201354 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW85201354 BCX8\"><ul><li><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Save £3 per ticket when you book 14+ days before your visit </span><span class=\"EOP SCXW85201354 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW85201354 BCX8\"><p><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">If you book in advance, you can save an additional £1 per ticket &nbsp;by booking IMAX screenings with start times between 15.15 – 18.00 </span><span class=\"EOP SCXW85201354 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW85201354 BCX8\"><p><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Find out more in </span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW85201354 BCX8\" href=\"/ticket-prices-faqs\" target=\"_blank\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"f26e464c-3997-451a-bde0-483c85b21af6\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">our FAQs</span></a><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW85201354 BCX8 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">.</span><span class=\"EOP SCXW85201354 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span></p></div>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-3\">\n\t  <span>            Universal Credit tickets\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-3\">\n              <ul><li>A limited number of £5 tickets are available to anyone in receipt of Universal Credit or some other benefits.</li><li>You can claim £5 tickets for up to five people per household.</li><li>Tickets are only available at least one day before your visit. If you can't find £5 tickets for the date you wish to book, this date is sold out but further dates are available.</li><li>Please see <a href=\"/universal-credit-ticket-discounts\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"d716c1a2-7e75-415f-a137-d7a427f3afd6\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">this page&nbsp;</a>for more details including which supporting documents are needed to show eligibility.</li></ul>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n      \n                </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n    \n  </div>\n</article>\n              \n\n<section class=\"o-section -secondary\" aria-labelledby=\"a-see-more-films\">\n    <div  class=\"slice view-mode-default o-container clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"o-container__padding\">\n                  <h2 id=\"a-see-more-films\" class=\"o-title o-title--section\">            See more films\n      </h2>\n                                      <div class=\"slice view-mode-grid-4-column\">\n      <div class=\"js-carousel-teaser\" data-carousel-slidesPerView=\"1\"> \n  <div class=\"o-grid o-grid--4-col\">\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/arctic-our-frozen-planet\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/FP2-2HPHH-JustinHofman_DC28538%20%281%29.jpg?h=9dd951d5&amp;itok=f3LU4K3s 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/FP2-2HPHH-JustinHofman_DC28538%20%281%29.jpg?h=9dd951d5&amp;itok=f3LU4K3s\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Arctic: Our Frozen Planet 3D (U) </span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            IMAX screening\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Now screening\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Join Benedict Cumberbatch as he explores the Arctic in an epic adventure across this magical realm of snow and ice.  \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/wild-asia-life-at-extremes\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/wild-asia-4%20%281%29.jpg?h=60873127&amp;itok=6RPrQllL 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/wild-asia-4%20%281%29.jpg?h=60873127&amp;itok=6RPrQllL\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Wild Asia: Life at Extremes 3D (U)</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            IMAX screening\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Now screening\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Embark on an epic journey across the wild lands of Asia, where breathtaking landscapes and extraordinary animals await around every corner.\n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/beautiful-planet-3d-u\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2020-11/A-Beautiful-Planet.jpg?h=3cf665d7&amp;itok=GG-n01r- 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2020-11/A-Beautiful-Planet.jpg?h=3cf665d7&amp;itok=GG-n01r-\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">A Beautiful Planet 3D (U)</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            IMAX screening\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Now showing\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Meet the crew on board the International Space Station and see stunning 3D views of Earth from space. Book early for cheaper prices. \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card -external\">\n  <a href=\"/imax-cinema\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n    <div class=\"c-card__img -default\">\n                  <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2022-06/D210933.jpeg?h=c6980913&amp;itok=-8q7qeYy 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2022-06/D210933.jpeg?h=c6980913&amp;itok=-8q7qeYy\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n\n      \n          </div>\n\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n      <h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">IMAX: The Ronson Theatre</span>\n\n      </h3>\n              <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            Book now\n      \n        </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <p>            Enjoy heart-pounding audio and awe-inspiring images while watching one of our immersive 3D documentaries on a screen the height of four double-decker buses.\n      </p>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n      \n              </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n      \n\n\n        </main>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <footer>\n      <div class=\"c-back-to-top-panel | js-sticky-footer\">\n  <div class=\"o-container\">\n    <div class=\"c-back-to-top-panel__wrapper\">\n      <a href=\"#main-wrapper\" class=\"c-back-to-top-panel__link | js-back-top\">\n        <span>Back to Top</span>\n\n        <svg class=\"o-icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n          <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n        </svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"c-footer\">\n                  <div class=\"o-container\">\n            <div class=\"c-footer__padding\">\n              <div class=\"c-footer__section c-footer__section--second clearfix\">\n                      <div class=\"c-footer__block -column\">\n      \n              <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <span>Location</span>\n                                    <ul class=\"o-list\">\n            